                                                "sense_id": "dc878e96-751c-3b69-99f5-6ffa5ee0af1e",
                                                "text": "Prosser's parting words sum up his views on what the ORR [Office of Rail and Road] really means to the industry,. For him, ORR is not simply a regulator, and HMRI's [His/Her Majesty's Railway Inspectorate's] purpose is not just about safety..."
